# Practice against Steady AI: the title, Play, the opponent list, three drops
# (a number key, a column click, arrows + Enter), Hint and Undo from the tray,
# the pause sheet and Resume, then Leave to menu.
until 600 Make four in a row
frames 150
save title
click =Play
until 120 Pick an opponent
frames 10
save practice
click =Steady AI
until 120 Your turn
frames 30
key Digit4 1
until 300 =Your turn
frames 60
click Column 4,
until 300 =Your turn
frames 60
save board
click Hint (H)
until 300 Hint: column
frames 10
click Undo (U)
until 120 Undid
frames 10
key KeyP 1
until 60 Restart this board
frames 10
save pause
click =Resume
frames 10
key Escape 1
until 60 Leave to menu
frames 10
click =Leave to menu
until 120 Make four in a row
